  "description": "Ha-Kyung, heir to the Joowon Hotel, is about to enter into an arranged marriage. \n\nThree weeks before the engagement ceremony, I receive a marriage proposal. From a man other than the one I was to marry. He was my fiancé's younger brother. \n\n*“You can't marry my brother! ”* \n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
